            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "怎么样，您准备好了吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7215407",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721540701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721540701": {
            "id": "721540701",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "还没准备好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721540702"
            ]
          },
          "721540702": {
            "id": "721540702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "那您接着准备吧，准备好了和我说一声就行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7215408",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721540801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721540801": {
            "id": "721540801",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "「映影」到底要拍什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721540802"
            ]
          },
          "721540802": {
            "id": "721540802",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "啊！好问题，非常好的问题。但老实说，我也没有想好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721540803"
            ]
          },
          "721540803": {
            "id": "721540803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "对我来说，「映影」可以拍任何东西。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721540804"
            ]
          },
          "721540804": {
            "id": "721540804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "爱情、悬疑、打斗，甚至是某些虚无缥缈的传说。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721540805"
            ]
          },
          "721540805": {
            "id": "721540805",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "但我总觉得，「映影」这种东西，有着某种我还没能发掘出来的魅力。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721540806"
            ]
          },
          "721540806": {
            "id": "721540806",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "泽维尔",
            "text": "不过，我觉得只要我再多拍些「映影」，总能得到答案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
